      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We'll continue with our AI Enterprise Workspace project and keep the same approach:\nConcept → Why → Real-world example → Project application → Interview question",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
