      "text": "Day 3 — Django Backend Foundation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Day 3 — Django Backend Foundation",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rVskuaIUCwOzpdA3rnWuV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 559.4619465977696,
      "y": 15650.290984024046,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 696702223,
      "version": 9,
      "versionNonce": 535890153,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Today we'll start turning our Day 1–2 design into an actual backend.\n\nToday's goal\n\nBy the end of today, you should understand:\n\nDjango project vs Django app\nHow a request travels through Django\nDjango's important files\nHow our project should be structured\nCustom User model\nWhy we should create a custom User model from the beginning\nOrganization and OrganizationMember models\nRelationships using Django ORM\nMigrations — what actually happens\nBasic API structure for signup",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Today we'll start turning our Day 1–2 design into an actual backend.\n\nToday's goal\n\nBy the end of today, you should understand:\n\nDjango project vs Django app\nHow a request travels through Django\nDjango's important files\nHow our project should be structured\nCustom User model\nWhy we should create a custom User model from the beginning\nOrganization and OrganizationMember models\nRelationships using Django ORM\nMigrations — what actually happens\nBasic API structure for signup",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZdjScvYL9nuCv98FXR6xz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520.4619465977696,
      "y": 16096.415984024046,
      "width": 407,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4R",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1283111361,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1513035303,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 1 — Django Project vs Django App",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 1 — Django Project vs Django App",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "VE2kdewBmKHnGuh-dXyrr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 570.3369465977696,
      "y": 16134.290984024046,
      "width": 539,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1366546319,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 1955726281,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "This is the first thing I want you to understand.\n\nImagine our entire product:\nAI Enterprise Workspace\nThat's our Django project.\nInside it, we have different business areas:\n\nAI Enterprise Workspace\n│\n├── authentication\n├── organizations\n├── teams\n├── projects\n├── tasks\n├── documents\n├── notifications\n└── ai\n\nThese are Django apps.\n\nThink:\nProject = entire house\nApp = individual room",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "This is the first thing I want you to understand.\n\nImagine our entire product:\nAI Enterprise Workspace\nThat's our Django project.\nInside it, we have different business areas:\n\nAI Enterprise Workspace\n│\n├── authentication\n├── organizations\n├── teams\n├── projects\n├── tasks\n├── documents\n├── notifications\n└── ai\n\nThese are Django apps.\n\nThink:\nProject = entire house\nApp = individual room",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "S51VwxwjHdPTCwFCB5nT1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 568.4619465977696,
      "y": 16748.415984024046,
      "width": 451,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1929362721,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1482144071,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why don't we put everything into one app?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why don't we put everything into one app?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GulLuI45q92_G9ApzpL-V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 602.5869465977696,
      "y": 16776.287077774046,
      "width": 473,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1043907119,
      "version": 35,
      "versionNonce": 1158718121,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Because our application will become large.\nImagine:\n\napp/\n    models.py\n    views.py\n    serializers.py\n    services.py\n    ...\n\n\nEventually:\nmodels.py → 3000 lines\nviews.py → 5000 lines\n\nVery difficult to maintain.\nInstead:\napps/\n├── users/\n├── organizations/\n├── teams/\n├── projects/\n├── tasks/\n└── ai/\n\nEach app owns a particular business domain.\nThis is called separation of concerns.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Because our application will become large.\nImagine:\n\napp/\n    models.py\n    views.py\n    serializers.py\n    services.py\n    ...\n\n\nEventually:\nmodels.py → 3000 lines\nviews.py → 5000 lines\n\nVery difficult to maintain.\nInstead:\napps/\n├── users/\n├── organizations/\n├── teams/\n├── projects/\n├── tasks/\n└── ai/\n\nEach app owns a particular business domain.\nThis is called separation of concerns.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "43J6Jv7jHB8lZyuevK8uK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 475.4619465977696,
      "y": 17525.415984024046,
      "width": 495,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1138727343,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1270806631,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 2 — How a request travels through Django",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 2 — How a request travels through Django",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZntMdnycGM3Gb4aW8UrK_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 531.5830403477696,
      "y": 17563.169890274046,
      "width": 704,
      "height": 1150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1894848513,
      "version": 28,
      "versionNonce": 236479881,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Suppose our frontend sends:\nPOST /api/auth/login\n\nThe request roughly travels:\n\nClient\n  ↓\nNginx / Load Balancer\n  ↓\nDjango\n  ↓\nURL Router\n  ↓\nView\n  ↓\nSerializer / Validation\n  ↓\nService / Business Logic\n  ↓\nDjango ORM\n  ↓\nPostgreSQL\n  ↓\nResponse\n  ↓\nClient\n\nFor example:\n\nPOST /api/auth/login\n        ↓\nurls.py\n        ↓\nLoginView\n        ↓\nvalidate email/password\n        ↓\nUser lookup\n        ↓\npassword verification\n        ↓\ngenerate tokens\n        ↓\nJSON response\n\nThis flow will become very important for our backend interviews.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Suppose our frontend sends:\nPOST /api/auth/login\n\nThe request roughly travels:\n\nClient\n  ↓\nNginx / Load Balancer\n  ↓\nDjango\n  ↓\nURL Router\n  ↓\nView\n  ↓\nSerializer / Validation\n  ↓\nService / Business Logic\n  ↓\nDjango ORM\n  ↓\nPostgreSQL\n  ↓\nResponse\n  ↓\nClient\n\nFor example:\n\nPOST /api/auth/login\n        ↓\nurls.py\n        ↓\nLoginView\n        ↓\nvalidate email/password\n        ↓\nUser lookup\n        ↓\npassword verification\n        ↓\ngenerate tokens\n        ↓\nJSON response\n\nThis flow will become very important for our backend interviews.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aVtGscL4dwZOpdRj3J39w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 451.4619465977696,
      "y": 18784.415984024046,
      "width": 319,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 594850383,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1244746631,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 3 — Our Django structure",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 3 — Our Django structure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3bq71GrgRHtBP3dYELW-N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 495.5830403477696,
      "y": 18815.415984024046,
      "width": 759,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1371984225,
      "version": 14,
      "versionNonce": 719637609,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Eventually, our project can look approximately like:\n\nenterprise_workspace/\n│\n├── manage.py\n│\n├── config/\n│   ├── settings.py\n│   ├── urls.py\n│   ├── asgi.py\n│   └── wsgi.py\n│\n├── apps/\n│   ├── users/\n│   ├── organizations/\n│   ├── teams/\n│   ├── projects/\n│   ├── tasks/\n│   ├── documents/\n│   ├── notifications/\n│   └── ai/\n│\n├── requirements/\n│\n├── Dockerfile\n│\n└── .env\n\nNotice something important:\nWe are not using Docker Compose, as you requested earlier.\nWe'll use Docker directly and later deploy the containers to AWS/EKS.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Eventually, our project can look approximately like:\n\nenterprise_workspace/\n│\n├── manage.py\n│\n├── config/\n│   ├── settings.py\n│   ├── urls.py\n│   ├── asgi.py\n│   └── wsgi.py\n│\n├── apps/\n│   ├── users/\n│   ├── organizations/\n│   ├── teams/\n│   ├── projects/\n│   ├── tasks/\n│   ├── documents/\n│   ├── notifications/\n│   └── ai/\n│\n├── requirements/\n│\n├── Dockerfile\n│\n└── .env\n\nNotice something important:\nWe are not using Docker Compose, as you requested earlier.\nWe'll use Docker directly and later deploy the containers to AWS/EKS.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YgBhQDC7ZkQOM-_g00wlT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 412.4619465977696,
      "y": 19651.415984024046,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1639552463,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 2079017639,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 4 — First important design decision",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 4 — First important design decision",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CfRQ3czuP1NDew0aeJIm4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 462.4619465977696,
      "y": 19692.165984024046,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 110790113,
      "version": 38,
      "versionNonce": 54613833,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789965106783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Before creating our models, we need to decide:\nWhat should our User model look like?\n\nDjango gives us a default User model.\n\nBut for our project, I want you to understand why we should consider a custom User model from Day 1.\n\nOur requirements include:\n\nUser\n├── email\n├── password\n├── first_name\n├── last_name\n├── is_active\n├── created_at\n└── updated_at\n\nAnd potentially later:\n\nOAuth\nEmail verification\nProfile\nSecurity settings\nLogin history\n\nSo instead of tightly coupling ourselves to Django's default user implementation, we can \ndefine our own user model.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Before creating our models, we need to decide:\nWhat should our User model look like?\n\nDjango gives us a default User model.\n\nBut for our project, I want you to understand why we should consider a custom User model from Day 1.\n\nOur requirements include:\n\nUser\n├── email\n├── password\n├── first_name\n├── last_name\n├── is_active\n├── created_at\n└── updated_at\n\nAnd potentially later:\n\nOAuth\nEmail verification\nProfile\nSecurity settings\nLogin history\n\nSo instead of tightly coupling ourselves to Django's default user implementation, we can \ndefine our own user model.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jXx71G-mEWfK8bwT47cUf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 374.4619465977696,
      "y": 20479.415984024046,
      "width": 517,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
